---
import CFiles from '../../layouts/CFiles.astro';import sources from '../../cfiles/sources.json';import news from '../../cfiles/news.json';
---
<CFiles title="Sources and review standards" active="Sources"><section class="cf-intro"><h1>Follow the source.</h1><p>A source directory, not an endorsement. Public records and independent reporting serve different roles.</p></section><section class="cf-source-list">{sources.map(s=>{const health=news.sources.find(r=>r.source===s.id);return <article><div><span class="cf-mono cf-gold">{s.type}</span><h2><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.name} ↗</a></h2></div><div><p>{s.access}</p>{health&&<p class="cf-source-health">{health.ok?'Feed connected':'Feed unavailable'} · checked {new Date(health.checked_at).toLocaleString('en-US',{timeZone:'UTC'})} UTC {health.ok?'':`· ${health.error}`}</p>}</div></article>;})}</section><section id="method" class="cf-method"><h2>How review works.</h2><ol><li><strong>Submit an account.</strong> Describe observations separately from interpretations. Evidence and reports start in a private queue.</li><li><strong>Review the record.</strong> A moderator checks relevance, consent, privacy, source links, and whether the description supports its claims.</li><li><strong>Publish with context.</strong> A published report can remain unreviewed or lack enough data for a conclusion. “Source documented” means a source exists, not that an extraordinary explanation is established.</li><li><strong>Keep the question open.</strong> Registered contributors can offer corroboration, source documents, or alternative explanations. Contributions are moderated too.</li></ol><p>News headlines link to their original publishers. The feed records its last check time and retains previous items on a source failure. The daily workflow must be enabled on the deployed repository; this preview is not a continuous live incident feed.</p><p>Map positions are approximate and are omitted where this archive has no reliable location. Do not use this site to locate individual witnesses.</p><p>Local review accounts and files stay on this computer. Hosted accounts, email confirmation, retention and deletion policies must be configured before public submissions open.</p></section></CFiles>
